{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第十八","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第十九","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十一","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十二","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十三","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十四","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十五","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十六","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十七","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十八","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第二十九","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第三十","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"附錄阿毗達磨俱舍論本頌","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第十一","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"尊者世親造","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"唐三藏法師玄奘奉詔譯","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"分別世品第三之四","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如是已說有情世間器世間今當說.頌曰.","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"安立器世間.　風輪最居下.　其量廣無數.　厚十六洛叉.","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"次上水輪深.　十一億二萬.　下八洛叉水.　餘凝結成金.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此水金輪廣.　徑十二洛叉.　[一]三千四百半.","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"周圍此三倍。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.許此三千大千世界如是安立形量不同。謂諸有情業增上力.先於最下依止","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"虛空有風輪生.廣無數厚十六億踰繕那.如是風輪其體堅密.假設有一大諾健那","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本此句開爲半頌雲.徑量有三千.復有四百半.","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"以金剛輪奮威懸擊.金剛有碎風輪無[一]損。又諸有情業增上力.起大雲雨澍風輪上.","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"滴如車軸積水成輪.如是水輪於未凝結位深十一億二萬踰繕那。如何水輪不傍","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"流散。有餘師說.一切有情業力所持令不流散.如所飲食未熟變時終不流移墮於","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"熟藏。有餘部說由風所持令不流散.如篅持穀。有情業力感別風起.搏擊此水上結","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"成金.如熟乳停上凝成膜.故水輪減唯厚八洛叉.餘轉成金厚三億二[二]萬.二輪廣量","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"其數是同.謂徑十二億三千四百半.周圍其邊數成三倍.謂周圍量成三十六億一","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"萬三百五十踰繕那。頌曰","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"(三）蘇迷盧處中.　次踰健達羅.　伊沙馱羅山.　朅地洛迦山.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"蘇達棃舍那.","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]頞濕縛羯拏.　毗那怛迦山.　尼民達羅山.　[五]於大洲等外.","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"有鐵輪圍山.　前七金所成.","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本次牒頌文次上水輪深十一億二萬二句.","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]三本次牒頌文此水金輪廣句.次二輪句移在三千四百半之下.","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]藏本此下四句合爲半頌.","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]藏本此下半頌合爲一句.","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]梵本此下半頌合一句.","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"蘇迷盧四寶.　入水皆八萬.　[一]妙高出亦然.","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"餘八半半下.　廣皆等高量。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.於金輪上有九大山.妙高山王處中而住.餘八周匝遶妙高山.於八山中前七","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"名[二]內.第七山外有大洲等.此外復有鐵輪圍山.周匝如輪圍一世[三]界.持雙等七唯金","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"所成.妙高山王四寶爲體.謂如次四面北東南西金銀吠琉璃頗胝迦寶.隨寶威德","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"色顯於空.故贍部洲空似吠琉璃色。如是寶等從何而生。亦諸有情業增上力.復大","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"雲起雨金輪上.滴如車軸積水奔濤.其水卽爲衆寶種藏.由具種種威德猛風.鑽擊","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"變生衆寶類等.如是變水生寶等時.因滅果體生不俱有.非如數論轉變所成。數論","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"雲何執轉變義。謂執有法自性常存.有餘法生有餘法滅。如是轉變何理相違。謂必","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"無容有法常住.可執別有法滅法生。誰言法外別有有法.唯卽此法於轉變時異相","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"所依名爲有法。此亦非理。非理者何。卽是此物而不如此.如是言義曾所未聞。如是","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本此句開爲半頌雲.此妙高出水.量亦復八萬.","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]三本次牒頌文於大洲等外有鐵輪圍山二句.","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]陳本藏本次牒頌文前七金所成句.","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"變生金寶等已.復由業力引起別風.簡別寶等攝令聚集成山成洲.分水甘鹹令別","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"成立內海外[一]海。如是九山住金輪上.入水量皆等八萬踰繕[二]那.蘇迷盧山出水亦爾.","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"餘八出水半半漸卑.謂初持雙出水四萬.乃至最後鐵輪圍山出水三百一十二[三]半.","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如是九山一一廣量.各各與自出水量同。頌曰","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"山間有[四]八海.　[五]前七名爲內.","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"最初廣八萬.　四邊各三倍.　餘六半半陿.　[六]第八名爲外.","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"三洛叉二萬.　[七]二千踰繕那。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.妙高爲初.輪圍最後。中間八海前七名內.七中皆具八功德水.一甘.二冷.三輭.","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四輕.五清淨.六不臭.七飲時不損喉.八飲已不傷腹.如是七海初廣八[八]萬.約持雙山.","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"內邊周量是其四面數各三倍.謂各成二億四萬踰繕那.其餘六海量半半陿.謂第","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二海量廣四萬.乃至第七量廣一千二百五十.此等不說周圍量者.以煩多故。第八","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文入水皆八萬句.","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]次牒頌文妙高出亦然句.","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]三本次牒頌文廣皆等高量句.","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]三本作七.","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]三本次二句頌文互倒雲.最初廣八萬.是名爲內海.","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[六]三本此句作所餘名外海.","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[七]原刻作一.今依麗刻及三本改.","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[八]三本次有釋文.並牒頌前七句.略釋.再牒頌文四邊各三倍句.","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"名外.鹹水盈滿.量廣三億二萬二千。頌曰","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]於中[二]大洲相.　南贍部如車.　三邊各二千.","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"南邊有三半.[三]東毗提訶洲.　其相如半月.　三邊如贍部.","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"東邊三百半.","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]西瞿陀尼洲.　其相圓無缺.　徑二千五百.　周圍此三倍.","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]北俱盧畟方.　面各二千等.","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[六]中洲復有八.　四洲邊各二。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.於外海中大洲有四.謂於四面對妙高山。南贍部洲北廣南陿.三邊量等.其相","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如車.南邊唯廣三踰繕那半.三邊各有二千踰繕那.唯此洲中有金剛座.上窮地際","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"下據金輪.一切菩薩將登正覺皆坐此座上.起金剛喻定.以無餘依及餘處所有堅","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"固力能持此[七]故。東勝身洲.東陿西廣.三邊量等.形如半[八]月.東三百五十.三邊各二[九]千。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本於中二字本屬於前頌末句.故陳本另作一段牒釋.","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]三本此下二句半合爲半頌.","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]三本此半頌合爲一句.","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]同上.","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]同上.","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[六]三本開爲一頌具出八洲名字.","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[七]三本次牒頌文東毗提訶洲其相如半月二句.(三本原爲一句.)","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[八]三本次牒頌文三邊如瞻部句.略釋.再牒頌文東邊三百半句.","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[九]三本次牒頌文西瞿陀尼洲等四句.分二段釋.","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"西牛貨洲.圓如滿月.徑二千五百.周圍七千[一]半。北俱盧洲.形如方座.四邊量等.面各","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二千.等言爲明無少增減。隨其洲相.人面亦[二]然。復有八中洲.是大洲眷屬.謂四大洲","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"側各有二中洲.贍部洲邊二中洲者.一遮末羅洲.二筏羅遮末羅洲.勝身洲邊二中","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"洲者.一提訶洲.二毗提訶洲.牛貨洲邊二中洲者.一舍搋洲.二嗢怛羅漫怛里拏洲.","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"俱盧洲邊二中洲者.一矩拉婆洲.二憍拉婆洲.此一切洲皆人所住.有說唯一邏剎","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"娑居。頌曰","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此北九黑山.　雪香醉山內.　無熱池縱廣.　五十踰繕那。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.此贍部洲從中向北三處各有[三]三重黑山.有大雪山在黑山北.大雪山北有香","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"醉[四]山.雪北香南有大池水名無熱惱.出四大河.一殑加河.二信度河.三徙多河.四縛","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"芻河.無熱惱池縱廣正等.面各五十踰繕那量.八功德水盈滿其中.非得通人無由","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"能至.於此池側有贍部林.樹形高大其果甘美.依此林故名贍部洲.或依此果以立","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本次牒頌文北俱盧畟方面各二千等二句.","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]三本次牒頌文中洲復有八四洲邊各二二句.(三本原爲一頌)","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]原刻作五.今依麗刻及三本改.","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]陳本藏本次牒頌文雪香醉山內等三句.","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"洲號。復於何處置捺落迦.大捺落迦何量有幾。頌曰.","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此下過二萬.　無間惱廣同.　上七捺落迦.　八增皆十六.","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"謂煻煨屍糞.　鋒刃烈河增.　各住彼四方.　餘八寒地獄。","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.此贍部洲下過二萬.有阿鼻旨大捺落迦.深廣同前.謂各二萬.故彼底去此四","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"萬踰繕那.以於其中受苦無間.非如餘七大捺落迦受苦非恆.故名無間.且如等活","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"捺落迦中.諸有情身雖被種種斫剌磨擣.而彼暫遇涼風所吹還活如本.由斯理故","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"立等活名.阿鼻旨中無如是事.有餘師說.阿鼻旨中無樂間苦故名無間.餘地獄中","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"有樂間起.雖無異熟而有等[一]流.七捺落迦在無間上重累而住.其七者何.一者極熱.","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二者炎熱.三者大叫.四者號叫.五者衆合.六者黑繩.七者等活.有說此七在無間傍。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"八捺落迦增各十六.故薄伽梵說此頌言.此八捺落迦.我說甚難越.以熱鐵爲地.周","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"匝有鐵牆.四面有四門.關閉以鐵扇.巧安布分量.各有十六增.多百踰繕那.滿中造","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文上七捺落迦句.","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"惡者.周徧焰交徹.猛火恆洞然。十六增[一]者.八捺落迦四面門外各有四所.一煻煨增.","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"謂此增內.煻煨沒膝.有情遊彼.纔下足時皮肉與血俱燋爛墜.舉足還生平復如本.","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二屍糞增.謂此增內.屍糞泥滿.於中多有娘矩吒蟲.[此/束]利如針.身白頭黑.有情遊彼.","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"皆爲此蟲鑽皮破骨.[口*帀]食其髓.三鋒刃增.謂此增內.復有三種.一刀刃路.謂於此中","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"仰布刀刃以爲大道.有情遊彼.纔下足時皮肉與血俱斷碎墜.舉足還生平復如本.","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二劍葉林.謂此林上純以銛利劍刃爲葉.有情遊彼.風吹葉墜.斬刺肢體骨肉零落.","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"有烏駮狗[摣-扌+齒]掣食之.三鐵刺林.謂此林上有利鐵刺長十六指.有情被逼.上下樹時.","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"其刺銛鋒.下上鑱刺.有鐵[此/束]鳥.探啄有情眼睛心肝.爭競而食.刀刃路等.三種雖殊.","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"而鐵仗同.故一增攝.四烈河增.謂此增量廣滿.中熱鹹水.有情入中.或浮或沒.或逆","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"或順.或橫或轉.被蒸被煑.骨肉靡爛.如大鑊中.滿盛灰汁.置麻米等.猛火下燃.麻等","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"於中上下迴轉.舉體糜爛.有情亦然.設欲逃亡.於兩岸上有諸獄卒.手執刀槍禦捍","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文謂煻煨屍糞等三句.","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"令迴.無由得出.此河如壍.前三似園.四面各四增故.言皆十六.此是增上被刑害所.","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"故說名增.本地獄中適被害已.重遭害故。有說有情從地獄出.更遭此苦.故說爲增。","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"今於此中因論生論.諸地獄卒是有情不。有說非情。如何動作。有情業力如成劫風。","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"若爾.雲何通彼大德法善現說.如彼頌雲.心常懷忿毒.好集諸惡業.見他苦欣悅.死","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"作琰魔卒。琰魔王使諸邏剎娑擲諸有情置地獄者名琰魔卒.是實有情.非地獄中","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"害有情者.故地獄卒非實有情。有說有情。若爾.此惡業何處受異熟。卽地獄中.以地","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"獄中尚容無間所感異熟.此何理遮。若爾.何緣火不燒彼。此定由業力所隔礙故.或","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"感異大種.故不被燒。熱捺落迦已說有[一]八.復有餘八寒捺落迦。其八者何。一頞部陀.","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二尼剌部陀.三頞哳吒.四臛臛婆.五虎虎婆.六嗢鉢羅.七鉢特摩.八摩訶鉢特摩.此","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"中有情嚴寒所逼.隨身聲變以立其名.此八並居贍部洲下.如前所說大地獄傍。此","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"贍部洲其量無幾.下寧容受無間等耶。洲如穀聚.上尖下闊.是故大海漸陿漸深。如","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文餘八寒地獄句.","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"上所論十六地獄.一切有情增上業感.餘孤地獄各別業招或多或二或一所止.差","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"別多種處所不定.或近江河山邊曠野.或在地下空及餘處.諸地獄器安布如是.本","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"處在下支派不定。傍生住處.謂水陸空.本處大海後流餘處.諸鬼本處琰魔王國.於","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此贍部洲下過五百踰繕那有琰魔王國.縱廣量亦爾.從此展轉散居餘處.或有端","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"嚴具大威德受諸富樂自在如天.或有飢羸顏貌醜陋.如是等類廣說如經。日月所","sortOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"居量等義者.頌曰.","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"日月迷盧半.　五十一.五十.　夜半日沒中.　日出四洲等.","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"雨際第二月.　後九夜漸增.　寒第四亦然.　夜減.晝翻此.","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"晝夜增臘縛.　行南北路時.　近日自影覆.　故見月輪缺。","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.日月衆星依何而住依風而住.謂諸有情業增上力共引風起.遶妙高山空中","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"旋環.運持日等令不停墜。彼所住去此幾踰繕那.持雙山頂.齊妙高山半。日月徑量","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"幾踰繕[一]那.日五十一.月唯五十.星最小者唯一俱盧舍.其最大者十六踰繕那.日輪","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"下面頗胝迦寶火珠所成.能熱能照.月輪下面頗胝迦寶水珠所成.能冷能照.隨有","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"情業增上所生.能於眼身果華稼穡藥草等物如其所應爲益爲損。唯一日月普於","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四洲作所作事.一日所作事爲四洲同時不.不爾.雲[二]何.北洲夜半.東洲日沒.南洲日","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"中.西洲日出.此四時等餘例應知。日行此洲路有差別.故令晝夜有減有[三]增.從雨際","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"第二月後半第九日夜漸[四]增.從寒際第四月後半第九日夜漸[五]減.晝增減位與此相","sortOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"違.夜漸增時晝便漸減.夜若漸減晝則漸增。晝夜增時一晝夜增[六]幾。增一臘縛.晝夜","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"減亦[七]然.日行此洲向南向北.如其次第夜增晝增。何故月輪於黑半末白半初位見","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"有缺[八]耶。世施設中作如是釋.以月宮殿行近日輪.月被日輪光所侵照.餘邊發影自","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"覆月輪.令於爾時見不圓滿。先舊師釋.由日月輪行度不同.現有圓缺。日等宮殿何","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"有情居四大天王所部天衆。是諸天衆唯住此耶。若空居天唯住如是日等宮殿.若","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文五十一五十句.","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]陳本藏本次牒頌文夜半日沒中日出四洲等二句.","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]三本次牒頌文雨際第二月後九夜漸增二句.","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]三本次牒頌文寒第四亦然夜減一句半.","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]三本次牒頌文查翻此半句.","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[六]陳本藏本次牒頌文晝夜增臘縛句.","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[七]二本次牒頌文行南北路時句.","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[八]二本次牒頌文近日自影覆故見月輪缺二句.","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"地居天住妙高山諸層級等。有幾層級.其量雲何.何等諸天住何層級。頌曰.","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"妙高層有四.　相去各十千.　傍出十六千.　八四二千量.","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]堅手及持鬘.　恆憍大王衆.　如次居四級.　亦住餘七山。","sortOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.蘇迷盧山有四層級.始從水際盡第一層相去十千踰繕那量.如是乃至從第","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"三層盡第四層亦十千[二]量.此四層級從妙高山傍出圍遶盡其下半.最初層級出十","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"六千.第二第三第四層級如其次第八四二[三]千.有藥叉神名爲堅手住初層級.有名","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"持鬘住第二級.有名恆憍住第三級.此三皆是四大天王所部天衆.第四層級四大","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"天王及諸眷屬共所居止.故經依此說四大王衆[四]天.如妙高山四外層級四大王衆","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"及眷屬居.如是持雙持軸山等七金山上亦有天居.是四大王所部封邑.是名依地","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"住四大王衆天.於欲天中此天最廣。三十三天住在何處。頌曰.","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"妙高頂八萬.　三十三天居.　四角有四峯.　金剛手所住.","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次半頌開爲三句.缺如次居四級句.","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]二本次牒頌文傍出十六千八四二千量二句.","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]二本次牒頌文堅手及持鬘等三句.","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]三本次牒頌文亦住餘七山句.","sortOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"中宮名善見.　周萬踰繕那.　高一半金城.　雜飾地柔軟.","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"中有殊勝殿.　周千踰繕那.　外四苑莊嚴.　衆車麤雜喜.","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"妙地居四方.　相去各二十.　東北圓生樹.　西南善法堂。","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.三十三天住迷盧頂.其頂四面各八十千.與下四邊其量無別。有餘師說周八","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"十千.別說四邊各唯二[一]萬。山頂四角各有一峯.其高廣量各有五百.有藥叉神名金","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"剛手於中止住守護諸天。於山頂[二]中.有宮名善見.面二千半.周萬踰繕那.金城量高","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"一踰繕那半.其地平坦亦真金所成.俱用百一雜寶嚴飾.地觸柔軟如妬羅綿.於踐","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"躡時隨足高下.是天帝釋所都大[三]城.於其城中有殊勝殿.種種妙寶具足莊嚴.蔽餘","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"天宮故名殊勝.面二百五十.周千踰繕那.是謂城中諸可愛[四]事。城外四面四苑莊嚴.","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"是彼諸天共遊戲處.一衆車苑.二麤惡苑.三雜林苑.四喜林苑.此爲外飾莊嚴大[五]城。","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四苑四邊有四妙地.中間各去苑二十踰繕那.是彼諸天勝遊戲處.諸天於彼角勝","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文四角有四峯金剛手所住二句.","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]二本次牒中宮名善見一頌.","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]二本次牒頌文中有殊勝殿周千踰繕那二句.","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]二本次牒頌文外四苑莊嚴眾車麤雜喜二句.","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]次牒頌文妙地居四方相去各二十二句.","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"歡[一]娛。城外東北有圓生樹.是三十三天受欲樂勝所.盤根深廣五[二]十踰繕那.聳幹上","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"昇.枝條傍布高廣量等百踰繕那.挺葉開華妙香芬馥.順風熏滿百踰繕那.若逆風","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"時猶遍五十。順風可爾.雲何逆熏。有餘師言.香無逆熏義.依不越樹界.故說逆熏。理","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"實圓生有如是德.所流香氣能逆風熏.雖天和風力所擁遏.然能相續流趣餘方.漸","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"劣漸微近處便歇.非能遠至如順風熏。如是華香爲依自地隨風相續轉至餘方.爲","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"但薰風別生香氣。此義無定.諸軌範師於此二門俱許無失。若爾.何故薄伽梵言.華","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"香不能逆風熏.根莖等香亦復爾.善士功德香芬馥.逆風流美遍諸方。據人間香故","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"作是說.以世共了無如是能。化地部經.說此香氣.順風熏滿百踰繕那.若無風時唯","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"遍五十。外西南角有善法堂.三十三天時集於彼詳論如法不如法事。如是已辯三","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"十三天所居外器.餘有色天衆所住器雲何。頌曰.","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此上有色天.　住依空宮殿。","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]次牒頌文東北圓生樹西南善法堂二句.","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]此字依麗刻及陳本藏本加.","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.此前所說三十三天上有色諸天住依空宮殿.雲何名上有色諸天.謂夜摩天.","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"覩史多天.樂變化天.他化自在天.及前所說梵衆天等.有十六處.幷前合有二十二","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"天.皆依外器。如是所說諸天衆中.頌曰.","sortOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"六受欲交抱.　執手笑視婬。","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.唯六欲天受妙欲[一]境.於中初二依地居天.形交成婬與人無別.然風氣泄熱惱","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"便除.非如人間有餘不淨.夜摩天衆纔抱成婬.覩史多天但由執手.樂變化天唯相","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"向笑.他化自在相視成婬.毗婆沙師作如是釋.六天皆以形交成婬.世施設中說相","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"抱等.但爲顯彼時量差別.以上諸天欲境轉妙貪心轉捷.故使之然。隨彼諸天男女","sortOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"膝上.有童男童女欻爾化生.卽說爲彼天所生男女.初生天衆身量雲何。頌曰.","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]初如五至十.色圓滿.有衣。","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.且六欲諸天初生如次.如五六七八九十歲[三]人.生已身形速得成滿.色界天衆.","sortOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本次牒頌文交抱執手笑视婬一句半.","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]陳本藏本此二句開爲一頌雲.初生如五歲.乃至於十歲.皆具諸色根.圓滿衣俱有.","sortOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]二本次牒頌文色圓滿有衣句.(三本原爲半頌)","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"於初生時身量周圓.具妙衣服.一切天衆皆作聖言.謂彼言詞同中印度。欲樂生別","sortOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"雲何應知。頌曰.","sortOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]欲生三人天.　樂生三九處。","sortOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.欲生三者.有諸有情樂受現前諸妙欲境.彼於如是現欲境中自在而轉.謂全","sortOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"人趣及下四天.有諸有情樂受自化諸妙欲境.彼於自化妙欲境中自在而轉.謂唯","sortOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"第五樂變化天.有諸有情樂受他化諸妙欲境.彼於他化妙欲境中自在而轉.謂第","sortOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"六他化自在天.依受如生現前欲境故.依受如樂自化欲境故.依受如樂他化欲境","sortOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"故.於欲界中分別欲生差別三[二]種。樂生三者.三靜慮中於九處生受三種樂.謂彼安","sortOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"住離生喜樂.定生喜樂.離喜樂故.長時安住.長時離苦.長時受樂.故名樂生。生靜慮","sortOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"中間都無喜樂.應思何故亦號樂生天。所說諸天二十二處上下相去其量雲何。頌","sortOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本此二句開爲一頌雲.欲生有三者.欲天及人俱.樂生亦有三.三禪中九地.","sortOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]三本次牒頌文樂生三九處句.(三本原爲半頌)","sortOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如彼去下量.　去上數亦然。","sortOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.一一中間踰繕那量非易可數.但可緫舉彼去下量.去上例然.隨從何天去下","sortOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"海量彼上所至與去下同.謂妙高山從第四層級去下大海四萬踰繕那是四大王","sortOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"本所住處.從彼上去三十三天亦如彼天去下海量.如三十三天去下大海上.去夜","sortOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"摩天其量亦爾.如是乃至如善見天去下大海踰繕那量.從彼上去色究竟天亦與","sortOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼天去下海等.從此向上無復所居.此處最高名色究竟。有餘師說.彼名礙究竟天.","sortOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼謂礙名目積集色.至彼礙盡得究竟名。於下處生昇見上不。頌曰.","sortOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"離通力依他.　下無昇見上。","sortOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_287","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.三十三天由自通力能從本處昇夜摩天.或復依他.謂得通者及上天衆接往","sortOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"夜摩.所餘諸天昇上例爾.若來若至下見上天.然下眼不能覩上界上地.非其境界","sortOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_289","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"故.如不覺彼觸.是故從上地來下地時.非自身來.要作下地化。有餘部說.彼下地天","sortOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_291","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"隨樂亦能見上地色.如生此界下見上天。[一]夜摩等天宮依處量有幾。有餘師說.此上","sortOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_292","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四天依處量同妙高山頂.有餘師說.上倍倍增.有餘師言.初靜慮地宮殿依處等一","sortOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_293","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四洲.第二靜慮等小千界.第三靜慮等中千界.第四靜慮等大千界.有餘師言.下三","sortOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_294","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"靜慮如次量等小中大千.第四靜慮量無邊際.齊何量說小中大千。頌曰.","sortOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_295","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"四大洲日月.　蘇迷盧欲天.　梵世各一千.　名一小千界.","sortOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_296","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"此小千千倍.　說名一中千.　此千倍大千.　皆同一成壞。","sortOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_297","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.千四大洲乃至梵世.如是總說爲一小[二]千.千倍小千名一中千[三]界.千中千界.總","sortOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_298","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"名一大[四]千.如是大千同成同壞.同成壞相後當廣辯。如外器量別.身量亦別耶。亦別。","sortOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_299","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"雲何。頌曰.","sortOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_300","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"贍部洲人量.　三肘半四肘.　東西北洲人.　倍倍增如次.","sortOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_301","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"欲天俱盧舍.　四分.一一增.　[五]色天踰繕那.","sortOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_303","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本卷九.","sortOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_304","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]陳本藏本次牒頌文此小千千倍說名一中千二句.","sortOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_305","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]次牒頌文此千倍大千句.","sortOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_306","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]次牒頌文皆同一成壞句.","sortOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_307","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]陳本藏本此句開爲半頌.","sortOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_309","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"初四增半半.　[一]此上增倍倍.　唯無雲減三。","sortOrder":309},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_310","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.贍部洲人.身多長三肘半.於中少分有長四[二]肘.東勝身人身長八肘.西牛貨人","sortOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_311","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"長十六肘.北俱盧人三十二[三]肘。欲界六天.最下身量一俱盧舍四分之一.如是後後","sortOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_312","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"一一分增.至第六天身一俱盧舍[四]半。色天身量.初梵衆天半踰繕[五]那.梵輔全一.大梵","sortOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_313","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"一半.少光二[六]全.此上餘天皆增倍倍.唯無雲減三踰繕那.謂無量光天倍增二至四.","sortOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_314","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"乃至色究竟增滿萬六千。身量旣殊夀量別不。亦別。雲何。頌曰.","sortOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_315","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"北洲定千年.　西東半半減.　此洲夀不定.　後十初叵量.","sortOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_316","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"人間五十年.　[七]下天一晝夜.　乘斯夀五百.","sortOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_317","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"上五倍倍增.　[八]色無晝夜殊.　劫數等身量.","sortOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_318","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"無色初二萬.　後後二二增.　少光上下天.　大全半爲劫。","sortOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_319","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.北俱盧人定夀千歲.西牛貨人夀五百歲.東勝身人夀二百五十[九]歲.南贍部人","sortOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_321","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本此句開爲半頌.","sortOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_322","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]陳本藏本次牒頌文東西北洲人倍倍增如次二句.","sortOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_323","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]三本次牒頌文欲天俱盧舍四分一一增二句.","sortOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_324","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]陳本藏本次牒頌文色天踰繕那句.(原爲半頌)","sortOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_325","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]次牒頌文初四增半半句.","sortOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_326","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[六]次牒頌文此上增倍倍唯無雲減三二句.(原爲三句)","sortOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_327","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[七]陳本藏本次半頌開爲三句.","sortOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_328","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[八]同上.","sortOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_329","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[九]陳本藏本次牒頌文此洲夀不定句.","sortOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_331","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"夀無定[一]限.劫減最後極夀十[二]年.於劫初時人夀無量.百千等數不能計量.已說人間","sortOrder":331},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_332","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"夀量長短。要先建立天上晝夜.方可算計天夀短長.天上雲何建立晝[三]夜。人五十歲","sortOrder":332},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_333","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"爲六天中最在下天一晝一[四]夜.乘斯晝夜三十爲月.十二月爲歲.彼夀五百年.上五","sortOrder":333},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_334","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"欲天漸俱增倍.謂人百歲爲第二天一晝一夜.乘此晝夜成月及年.彼夀千歲.夜摩","sortOrder":334},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_335","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"等四.隨次如人二四八百千六百歲爲一晝夜.乘此晝夜成月及年.如次彼夀二四","sortOrder":335},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_336","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"八千萬六千歲。持雙以上日月並無.彼天雲何建立晝夜.及光明事依何得成。依華","sortOrder":336},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_337","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"開合建立晝夜.如拘物陀鉢特摩等.又依諸鳥鳴靜差別.或依天衆寤寐不同.依自","sortOrder":337},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_338","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"身光明.成外光明事.已說欲界天夀短長。色界天中無晝夜別.但以劫數知夀短長.","sortOrder":338},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_339","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼劫夀短長與身量數等.謂若身量半踰繕那夀量半劫.若彼身量一踰繕那夀量","sortOrder":339},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_340","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"一劫.乃至身量長萬六千夀量亦同萬六千劫.已說色界天夀短[五]長。無色四天.從下","sortOrder":340},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_341","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如次夀量二四六八萬劫。上所說劫.其量雲何.爲壞爲成爲中爲大。少光已上大全","sortOrder":341},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_343","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]陳本藏本次牒頌文後十一語.","sortOrder":343},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_344","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]次牒頌文初叵量一語.","sortOrder":344},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_345","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]次牒頌文人間五十年下天一晝夜二句.","sortOrder":345},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_346","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[四]次牒頌文乘斯夀五百句.","sortOrder":346},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_347","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[五]次牒頌文無色初二萬後後二二增二句.","sortOrder":347},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_349","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"爲劫.自下諸天大半爲劫.卽由此故說大梵王過梵輔天夀一劫半.謂以成住壞各","sortOrder":349},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_350","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"二十中劫.六十中劫爲一劫半.故以大半四十中劫爲下三天所夀劫量。已說善趣","sortOrder":350},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_351","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"夀量短長.惡趣雲何。頌曰.","sortOrder":351},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_352","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"等活等上六.　如次以欲天　夀爲一晝夜.　夀量亦同彼.","sortOrder":352},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_353","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"極熱半中劫.　無間中劫全.　傍生極一中.　鬼月日五百.","sortOrder":353},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_354","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"頞部陀夀量.　如一婆訶麻　百年除一盡.　後後倍二十。","sortOrder":354},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_355","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.四大王等六欲天夀.如其次第爲等活等六捺落迦一晝一[一]夜.夀量如[二]次亦同","sortOrder":355},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_356","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼天.謂四大王夀量五百.於等活地獄爲一晝一夜.乘此晝夜成月及年.以如是年","sortOrder":356},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_357","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼夀五百.乃至他化夀萬六千於炎熱地獄爲一晝一夜.乘此晝夜成月及年.彼夀","sortOrder":357},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_358","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如斯萬六千[三]歲.極熱地獄夀半中劫.無間地獄夀一中劫。傍生夀量多無定限.若夀","sortOrder":358},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_359","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"極長亦一中劫.謂難陀等諸大龍王.故世尊言大龍有八.皆住一劫能持大地。鬼以","sortOrder":359},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_361","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]藏本次牒頌文夀量亦同彼句.","sortOrder":361},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_362","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[二]原刻下衍第字.今依麗刻删.","sortOrder":362},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_363","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[三]陳本藏本次分五段牒頌文極熱半中等八句.","sortOrder":363},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_365","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"人間一月爲一日.乘此成月歲夀五百年。寒那落迦雲何夀量。世尊寄喻顯彼夀言.","sortOrder":365},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_366","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"如此人間佉梨二十成摩朅陀國一麻婆訶量.有置巨勝平滿其中.設復有能百年","sortOrder":366},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_367","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"除一.如是巨勝易有盡期.生頞部陀夀量難盡.此二十倍爲第二夀.如是後後二十","sortOrder":367},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_368","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"倍增.是謂八寒地獄夀量。此諸夀量有中夭耶。頌曰.","sortOrder":368},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_369","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]諸處有中夭.　除北俱盧洲。","sortOrder":369},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_370","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"論曰.諸處夀量皆有中夭.唯北俱盧定夀千歲.此約處說非別有情.有別有情不中","sortOrder":370},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_371","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"夭故.謂住覩史多天一生所繫菩薩.及最後有.佛記佛使.隨信法行.菩薩輪王母懷","sortOrder":371},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_372","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"彼二胎時.此等如應皆無中夭。","sortOrder":372},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_373","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"阿毗達磨俱舍論卷第十一","sortOrder":373},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_369_375","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_369","text":"[一]三本此半頌合爲一句.","sortOrder":375}],"overrides":{}}